StrawWU Desktop Meta Package
============================

This meta package declares the StrawWU desktop dependency set without
Ubuntu telemetry or snapd packages.

Replacement path:
  - W3-D1: deb scaffold + preflight (this package)
  - W5-B4: disable upstream ubuntu-desktop on installed systems
  - W6-B5: ubuntu-* meta audit / full replacement

Session:
  strawwu-session registers GDM entry; interim GNOME Shell until W4-D2 shell.

Forbidden in Depends/Recommends:
  snapd, apport, whoopsie, ubuntu-report, ubuntu-pro-client

See docs/plans/strawwu-desktop-plan.md
